OL,3,GNEWSACCTV released after sex attacks on
OL,4,Agirls in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have released a CCTV image in
OL,7,Fconnection with a rape and sexual
OL,8,Fassault investigation.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said two
OL,11,F14-year-old girls got into conversation
OL,12,Fwith four males who they did not know
OL,13,Fin Florence Park, Oxford, on 28 July.
OL,15,FPolice said the girls and two males
OL,16,Fthen went to a wooded area of Marsh
OL,17,FPark, where one male raped one of the
OL,18,Fgirls while the other sexually
OL,19,Fassaulted the second girl.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
