OL,3,GNEWSACCTV released after sex attacks on
OL,4,Agirls in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigating officer Det Con Sarah
OL,7,FTibble, of the child abuse
OL,8,Finvestigation unit, said she believed
OL,9,Fthe male in the CCTV image "may have
OL,10,Fvital information" that could progress
OL,11,Fthe police investigation.
